# Optional. A Hugging Face access token with READ scope only.
#
# The dashboard works fully WITHOUT this — it only reads public repositories.
# Supplying a token raises your rate limit against the public Hub API
# (unauthenticated requests are throttled per-IP and can 429 on refresh).
#
# The token is read server-side only and is never sent to the browser.
# Create one at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in. .env.local is gitignored.
HF_TOKEN=

# Dev-only offline render. Serves obviously-synthetic sample payloads so the UI
# can be laid out without network access, and shows a loud FIXTURE DATA banner
# while active. Ignored entirely in production builds. Leave commented out.
# HF_FIXTURES=1
